OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy today with outbreaks of
OL,6,Frain, turning increasingly heavy at
OL,7,Ftimes. Winds strengthening through the
OL,8,Fmorning and into the afternoon.
OL,9,FFeeling more humid later today.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FFurther outbreaks of rain are
OL,12,Flikely this evening and tonight, but
OL,13,Fit will gradually turn drier from the
OL,14,Fnorth in the early hours with some
OL,15,Fclear spells. Winds easing.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FA cloudy start on Sunday with
OL,18,Fsome showery outbreaks of rain at
OL,19,Ffirst, but some brighter spells likely
OL,20,Fdeveloping in the afternoon. Light
OL,21,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
